# IDE
# Ignore the root .vscode/ contents, but track the two files that are
# deliberately the team's shared editor config: settings.json (formatter/eslint/ts
# + CloudFormation schema validation via yaml.schemas) and extensions.json (the
# recommendation / unwantedRecommendations mirror of the devcontainer's canonical
# extension set). `.vscode/*` (middle separator) is root-anchored, so the two
# workspace-root globs below are still needed to keep per-package IDE dirs local. (#524)
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
apps/*/.vscode/
packages/*/.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn

# Turbo
.turbo/

# Vite
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*

# Credentials
credentials.md
